    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard needs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 50,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**This is not the bundled Prometheus.** The chart's Prometheus keeps `retention: 30m` and exists to feed KEDA; it cannot answer a question about yesterday. Point this dashboard at your long-retention store.\n\n**SLI 1 needs kube-state-metrics** running with `config/monitoring/kube-state-metrics-config.yaml` applied and `--custom-resource-state-config-file` set. Without it the `ome_inferenceservice_transition_status` panels are empty.\n\n**SLI 2 needs the OME control-plane pods scraped** \u2014 `ome_isvc_time_to_ready_seconds` is exported by the controller-manager.\n\nThere is no warm/cold model split here. Model-resident nodes are selected by a hard `nodeSelector`, so a serving pod is only created once the weights are already local \u2014 the download happens before the pod exists and is invisible to this measurement."
      }
